sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Screen as Android Touchscreen
    participant Gesture as Gesture Engine
    participant Haptic as Local Haptic Engine
    participant Queue as Event Queue
    participant Network as WebSocket
    participant Receiver as Mac Receiver
    participant Validator as Security Validator
    participant Controller as Mac Input Controller
    participant OS as macOS

    User->>Screen: Tap touchpad
    Screen->>Gesture: MotionEvent
    Gesture->>Gesture: Check duration and movement
    Gesture->>Gesture: Classify as single tap

    par Immediate local tactile feedback
        Gesture->>Haptic: CLICK event
        Haptic->>Haptic: Select haptic profile
        Haptic-->>User: Physical vibration feedback
    and Remote click transmission
        Gesture->>Queue: Create click event
        Queue->>Network: Serialize event
        Network->>Receiver: Encrypted WebSocket message
        Receiver->>Validator: Validate session and sequence
        Validator->>Controller: Approved event
        Controller->>OS: CGEvent mouse down/up
        OS-->>User: Mac performs click
    end

